[[Open This|6. Related CLI references]]

---

Besides the commands covered in this guide, there are additional ones for managing BGP config, announcements, and related network settings. Here is a quick summary of the relevant CLI commands:

Modify/query BGP announce set and originated routes

    [[oxide system networking bgp announce-set]]

    [[oxide system networking bgp announcement list]]

Modify/query BGP configuration or peers

    [[oxide system networking bgp config]]

    [[oxide system networking bgp peer]]

Modify/query BGP session filtering criteria

    [[oxide system networking bgp exported]]

    [[oxide system networking bgp imported]]

    [[oxide system networking bgp filter]]

Modify route local preference

    [[oxide system networking bgp peer set --local-pref]]

    [[oxide system networking bgp pref --local-pref]]

Modify switch port addresses

    [[oxide system networking addr]]

Modify/query address lots

    [[oxide system networking address-lot]]